  "releaseNotes": "# Release Notes\n\n## 3.0.0\n\n### Added\n\n- add model `lyria-realtime-exp` (8f38cb1)\n- add model `gemini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-12-2025` (92816d9)\n- add model `deep-research-pro-preview-12-2025` (0af11f8)\n- add code generator (8d6804e)\n- add GenAI Client (8308439)\n- add `Interactions` (44b3855)\n- add `Interaction` API (f0c8fad)\n- add `Interaction` specific enums add debugger information (b45c94c)\n- add types for `genai` compatibility (f526257)\n- add logging for Client and Live (f2281c0)\n- refactor tests to `Shouldly` (d83cc10)\n- implement Automatic Function Call (AFC)\n- add automatic function calling (82a44e8)\n- add test for automatic function calling (c666c9b)\n- add overloading methods for streaming API calls (5fc6757)\n- add streaming POST method (fb39cbe)\n- add polymorphism handling for `Content` (70b4df3)\n- generate `ThinkingLevel` globally (8ddb398)\n- add medium and minimal thinking level (78cf867)\n- generate `ThinkingLevel` globally (1ca480f)\n- add property `ThinkingLevel` (Interaction API) (423b247)\n- generate `ThinkingLevel` globally (08fb37d)\n- add tests for Interaction API (2e5f6e5)\n- add polymorhpism to generate content (bd12c2a)\n- add flexible enum serialization (135ca7c)\n- add ultra high media resolution (1dabf7b)\n- add type `InteractionSseEvent` (a48773d)\n- call server-side events endpoint of Interaction API (53ad3cf)\n- generate global enum `TuningMode` (d52dcd2)\n- use custom type for `ContentFilter.Reason` (fd8df88)\n- generate global enum `TaskType` (ee52b23)\n- generate global enums `DynamicRetrievalConfigMode` and `FunctionCallingConfigMode` (d415640)\n- add `ILogger` interface (898c217)\n- add `ReplicatedVoiceConfig` (0bdf5b2)\n- add better access to discovery files (89b2358)\n- use `List<>` (eb80d1e)\n- explicitly ignore type `Model` (2e168fd)\n- generate concatenated enum files (11a365f)\n- add option to skip the download from the APIs (67ac75a)\n- add semi-automatic script to generate C# types. (a070122)\n- set sorted baseline of Discovery APIs (a636a85)\n- change location of `Client` (e10806c)\n- add MAUI sample (ab4dd15)\n- add XML docs (7c6c3eb)\n- add a couple of fluent extension methods #148 (058978d)\n- add test for streaming content (c1c2e22)\n- add debugger information (f102249)\n- add delegate invocation (b2d17f0)\n- add tests for tool usage (c18ecd4)\n- add dynamic function invocation (f4c1de6)\n- add enum member value (Interaction API) (8ae3fae)\n- add command switch to specify API version (b7858ef)\n- add test for GenAI Interactions (9758fb5)\n- add using statement (f7ab88e)\n- add condition for using statement (5c92f06)\n- add prefix to generated files (4ba46d7)\n- add GenAI types (00a8ab8)\n- flatten types location (c53d1fc)\n- generate Discovery types (381c404)\n- generate Discovery types (d8a6c87)\n- add auto generated types (8585f36)\n- add auto generated types (283b5d0)\n- add auto generated types (4e431dc)\n- add auto generated types (f94c1cb)\n- add auto generated types (5af6381)\n- add auto generated types (6ec0dab)\n- add auto generated types (2db0653)\n- generate enum types (83fd703)\n- add type replacements (c3393e3)\n- add new type replacement (f3590d3)\n- add new type replacement (309e171)\n\n### Changed\n\n- refactor tests to `Shouldly` (50be963)\n- improve `FunctionResponse` value (83b3e19)\n- replace `JsonStringEnumConverter` with `FlexibleEnumConverterFactory` converter while writing (1b43b1f)\n- evaluate `JsonStringEnumMemberNameAttribute` and `EnumMemberAttribute` (e3c9f6f)\n- change scope of `HttpClientFactory` field (6b43d67)\n- use snake case to read API response (9b9136e)\n- use default ctor (0095281)\n- simplify ctor use (1285112)\n- change scope of ctor (cb77abf)\n- improve RegEx match pattern (f26d95e)\n- truncate JSON output for logging (8bdd72a)\n- truncate thoughtSignature in logs (5d0f63e)\n- sync differences between API versions (811a825)\n- sync API v1alpha and v1beta (a3f4104)\n- add replacement (c707e41)\n- improve type generation (ce791ef)\n- improve XML comments (1ab7436)\n- review assignment of `accessToken` (df7da0c)\n- change expected test result (376f14f)\n- amend log description (06c314b)\n- use Access Token for Vertex AI (0ac586c)\n- cleanup rebase from `main` (99ff615)\n- complete rebase from `main` generate Discovery types (ff14cae)\n- substitute types with generated code (0ef8d71)\n- remove duplicate code covered by generation (2f40c75)\n- refactor enum access (b9ba274)\n- remove obsolete types (12003b0)\n- handling of nullable type (54a049e)\n- adjust placement in order of execution (367bb8a)\n- refactor / move types to new namespace (ef5d765)\n- remove duplicate code covered by generation (dcab036)\n- remove duplicate code covered by generation (71afc7a)\n- remove duplicate code covered by generation (dd75732)\n- update model (00a81b3)\n- housekeeping (c641e30)\n- change parameter type (0cb4cac)\n- remove duplicate code covered by generation (ffbd969)\n- revision 20251215 (040972f)\n- revision 20251215 (0d1bac3)\n- revision 20251212 (c036183)\n- revision 20251211 (84ace7d)\n- revision 20251210 (c6b2642)\n- revision 20251210 (e7c1816)\n- revision 20251210 (2eeee41)\n- improve code generation (87baca4)\n- remove duplicate code covered by generation (c91f764)\n- remove duplicate code covered by generation (d60f2e6)\n- ignore IDE warning (981bcea)\n- avoid property name conflict (3faa00c)\n- ignore certain type members (48eab86)\n- update namespace and using statements (a5a47ee)\n- update namespace and using statements (b825697)\n- update namespace and using statements (bb6eb4d)\n- change to generated types (Discovery API) (b193629)\n- create unique partial types and unified enums (926fa61)\n- refactor for new namespace and types (28d25a5)\n- remove auto-generated files from repository ;-) (25a280f)\n- refactor tests for generated types (06c4169)\n- change to generated types (Discovery API) (1e625d0)\n- change to generated types (Discovery API) (f2f220d)\n- remove inappropriate types (0035dfd)\n- update generated types (424fad2)\n- regenerate types (857116a)\n- housekeeping (74b86e0)\n- housekeeping (52a9d3f)\n- substitute common type names (b4f29c5)\n- remove last linefeed (d3cf146)\n- remove last linefeed (11e7b0f)\n- update generated types (feef5e7)\n- flatten enum to types folder (5f43ec8)\n- restore previous state (cf6f184)\n- stick to .NET 9.0 (samples) (7aebc88)\n- use unlimited session turns (a5a12bc)\n- upgrade Nuget packages (c0a8e42)\n- Merge pull request #160 from mscraftsman/dependabot/nuget/Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Abstractions-10.1.1 (2c937b6)\n- Bump Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Abstractions from 10.1.0 to 10.1.1 (d28d58a)\n- chore: add / amend XML docs (f46bc29)\n- revision 20251204 (86bd893)\n- revision 20251208 (0c031c9)\n- remove model `gemini-2.0-pro-exp` remove model `gemini-2.0-pro-exp-02-05` remove model `gemini-2.0-flash-live-001` (342a563)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- fix test configuration fixture (dc764d9)\n\n## Changelog\n\nChanges across all versions have been documented in the [Changelog](CHANGELOG.md).",
